| Criterion | Result |
| --- | --- |
| One deploy path | Pass — `scripts/vps-deploy/` (CI + README) |
| Zero root ad-hoc helpers on disk | Pass after 1b (`tmp-restart-*` removed) |
| Zero tracked rebuildable bytecode for candidates | Pass — pycache deletions staged |
| TEMP/temp untouched | Pass |
| Deferred docs still dirty | Pass (8 paths) |

**PSR-1 gate: GREEN** once this commit lands.
